# Each project folder ignores its own build output too (firmware/remote,
# firmware/power-test, companion, firmware/remote/tools/fonts).

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Logs and captures (hm-capture.ps1, hm-netlog.ps1 -Out)
*.log

# Signing keys. The companion's build makes its own debug.keystore when
# there is none; keep yours on disk (companion/README.md). Private keys
# (*.pem) too; the update key's public half is the one PEM in the repo.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
!firmware/remote/main/update_key.pem

# devtools.py's default output, from wherever it runs: screens can show
# network and TV names
screenshot.png
screenshot.bmp

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The user's own setup notes for Claude Code (board MAC, addresses, TV)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Research and notes that stay private (moved out of git 2026-10-14)
private/
